== Effect ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that floats slowly around the room on a zig-zag pattern similar to {{i|The Peeper}} and fires [[spectral]] and [[homing]] tears that deal 3.5 damage.
** {{dlc|nr}} The familiar shoots once per second.
** {{dlc|r}} The familiar shoots once every 3/4ths of a second.

== Notes ==
* Unlike {{i|The Peeper}}, ???'s Soul does no contact damage.
* {{dlc|nr}} ???'s Soul is unable to shoot while flying over obstacles (which is the same behavior that {{i|Ghost Baby}} has).

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Spawns 1 more familiar, this effect stacks to a maximum of 3 familiars at a time.
* {{i|Box of Friends}}: No effect; does not duplicate.
* {{i|Sacrificial Altar}}: Sacrifices the familiar, destroying the trinket and generating an item normally.

